WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.283 --> 00:00:16.444
and Mog helped Mr.

2
00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:17.885
Creepy clean up the lab.

3
00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:27.133
When everything was back in order, Waldo volunteered to demonstrate some simple science experiments.

4
00:00:27.153 --> 00:00:30.676
"Yeah!" yelled a tall boy.

5
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.201
"We want to see the wizard do some magic!"

6
00:00:35.462 --> 00:00:37.322
Mr. Freaky nodded at Waldo.

7
00:00:37.342 --> 00:00:41.324
"If you're feeling well enough, Waldo, please go ahead.

8
00:00:41.924 --> 00:00:44.625
I'm going to see if the office ogre has found Deb yet.

9
00:00:45.566 --> 00:00:50.108
I hope this mystery girl—whoever she is—hasn't harmed Deb too."

10
00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.912
Waldo did some simple experiments, which calmed everyone down.

11
00:01:02.892 --> 00:01:05.594
But Ben was too busy thinking to pay attention.

12
00:01:07.015 --> 00:01:08.917
What if the mystery girl attacked Winnie?

13
00:01:09.477 --> 00:01:10.838
Where was Winnie anyway?

14
00:01:11.619 --> 00:01:13.401
And what was the special assignment?

15
00:01:13.421 --> 00:01:18.024
"I'll ask Miss Bungle," thought Ben as Mr.

16
00:01:18.104 --> 00:01:19.686
Freaky came back into the lab.

17
00:01:29.253 --> 00:01:32.476
wizard here is pretty talented, Freaky," said Mayor Hubbletree.

18
00:01:33.952 --> 00:01:34.633
"How did he—?"

19
00:01:35.193 --> 00:01:37.274
The loudspeaker's shriek cut him off.

20
00:01:38.295 --> 00:01:40.377
The mayor clapped his hands over his ears.

21
00:01:40.397 --> 00:01:43.359
"What is that horrible sound?"

22
00:01:43.379 --> 00:01:47.461
"The lunch bell, of course," said Mr.

23
00:01:47.502 --> 00:01:50.644
Freaky. "Then let's eat lunch," Ms.

24
00:01:50.704 --> 00:01:51.344
Prim put in.

25
00:01:52.305 --> 00:01:53.746
Mayor Hubbletree scowled.

26
00:01:53.766 --> 00:01:56.368
"What is for lunch, Freaky?

27
00:01:56.828 --> 00:01:58.869
Some kind of disgusting monster food?"

28
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.351
"Actually," Mr.

29
00:02:01.431 --> 00:02:08.584
Freaky replied, "the cafeteria trolls are serving something that you humans love—pizza."

30
00:02:10.265 --> 00:02:12.527
"Oh." The mayor looked surprised.

31
00:02:12.547 --> 00:02:15.108
"That sounds pretty good."

32
00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.712
Everyone headed downstairs to the cafeteria.

33
00:02:20.832 --> 00:02:24.335
As Ben searched the hallway for Miss Bungle, he spotted Winnie.

34
00:02:25.155 --> 00:02:29.558
The witch was walking away from her locker, holding a broom and a lunch bag.

35
00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:35.790
"Winnie!" Ben shot after her, zigzagging between monsters and people.

36
00:02:37.231 --> 00:02:39.912
The office ogre abruptly stepped into his path.

37
00:02:40.633 --> 00:02:42.494
"Has anyone seen Deb?"

38
00:02:42.514 --> 00:02:46.016
Shloomp! Ben flew right through the ogre.

39
00:02:46.036 --> 00:02:48.557
"Ouch!" cried the office ogre.

40
00:02:48.577 --> 00:02:51.799
"Sorry!" Ben called over his shoulder.

41
00:02:51.819 --> 00:02:55.021
A second later Ben caught up to Winnie.

42
00:02:56.261 --> 00:02:57.442
He tapped her on the shoulder.

43
00:02:58.363 --> 00:03:00.564
Startled, Winnie spun to face him.

44
00:03:01.852 --> 00:03:02.653
"Oh. Hi, Ben."

45
00:03:02.673 --> 00:03:05.776
"Where have you been all morning?"

46
00:03:06.116 --> 00:03:06.716
asked Ben.

47
00:03:06.736 --> 00:03:10.179
"Miss Bungle said you're working on a special assignment."

48
00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:11.180
He paused.

49
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.882
"And you weren't in the flyover."

50
00:03:17.646 --> 00:03:19.507
remind me," Winnie muttered.

51
00:03:19.527 --> 00:03:21.869
"What do you mean?"

52
00:03:22.309 --> 00:03:22.930
asked Ben.

53
00:03:24.011 --> 00:03:24.812
Winnie huffed.

54
00:03:26.293 --> 00:03:29.776
"Don't remind me that I wasn't selected for the broom flying squad."

55
00:03:31.596 --> 00:03:32.637
Ben was shocked.

56
00:03:32.657 --> 00:03:35.338
"Why weren't you selected?"

57
00:03:37.319 --> 00:03:38.220
Winnie flushed.

58
00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:40.441
"I failed my broom flying exam.

59
00:03:42.342 --> 00:03:45.384
So now I'm just some loser who can't fly a broom by herself."

60
00:03:46.785 --> 00:03:48.225
Ben blinked in surprise.

61
00:03:48.245 --> 00:03:50.687
"But you're so good at flying.

62
00:03:50.727 --> 00:03:51.467
What happened?"

63
00:03:51.487 --> 00:03:55.950
"I got really nervous," Winnie explained.

64
00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:59.772
"The test was hard, and I felt so much pressure.

65
00:04:02.048 --> 00:04:04.951
I just started making stupid mistakes with my broom."

66
00:04:06.552 --> 00:04:07.212
She sighed.

67
00:04:07.232 --> 00:04:11.696
"What good is a witch who can't even fly her own broom?"

68
00:04:11.716 --> 00:04:17.281
"What good is a ghost who can't float through doors?"

69
00:04:17.661 --> 00:04:19.863
Ben said, trying to make her laugh.

70
00:04:19.883 --> 00:04:22.085
"I got stuck in one today."

71
00:04:23.206 --> 00:04:24.086
Winnie giggled.

72
00:04:25.488 --> 00:04:26.008
"You did?"

73
00:04:26.028 --> 00:04:30.452
"Yeah, right in front of the whole school," said Ben.

74
00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:34.302
"Including all the humans from People Place!"

75
00:04:35.963 --> 00:04:36.843
Winnie laughed.

76
00:04:36.864 --> 00:04:41.827
"Sorry, I shouldn't laugh, but that is funny!"

77
00:04:41.847 --> 00:04:44.529
"Can you retake the test?"

78
00:04:45.149 --> 00:04:45.790
asked Ben.

79
00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:47.811
Winnie nodded.

80
00:04:47.831 --> 00:04:51.093
"Miss Bungle told me I can retake it tomorrow.

81
00:04:52.614 --> 00:04:55.056
She's letting me spend today practicing and studying.

82
00:04:56.997 --> 00:04:58.378
That's my special assignment."

83
00:05:00.279 --> 00:05:02.032
"Awesome," said Ben.

84
00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:05.814
"And just think—even if you fail again, it's not a big deal.

85
00:05:05.834 --> 00:05:10.836
You'll just be one of those thirty-year-old witches whose parents still fly them around."

86
00:05:15.038 --> 00:05:20.241
funny!" Winnie laughed as she playfully punched Ben on the shoulder.

87
00:05:20.261 --> 00:05:23.022
"I'm just kidding," said Ben.

88
00:05:23.042 --> 00:05:25.723
"I know," said Winnie.

89
00:05:25.743 --> 00:05:27.444
"I should get back to work.

90
00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:32.682
I'm going to eat my lunch in the library while I read about broom flying techniques."

91
00:05:35.264 --> 00:05:36.484
"Okay," said Ben.

92
00:05:36.504 --> 00:05:37.465
"Good luck!"

93
00:05:39.046 --> 00:05:42.508
Ben watched as Winnie headed around the corner, toward the library.

94
00:05:43.488 --> 00:05:46.430
He was sure that she would pass the test the next time.

95
00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:51.072
Feeling much better, Ben floated down to the cafeteria.

96
00:05:56.375 --> 00:05:59.285
But when he got there, he saw that something was wrong.

97
00:06:03.647 --> 00:06:05.608
Mayor Hubbletree was yelling at Mr.

98
00:06:05.668 --> 00:06:06.389
Freaky again.

99
00:06:07.149 --> 00:06:09.891
Ms. Prim was standing near them, looking ill.

100
00:06:09.911 --> 00:06:13.353
"This is disgusting!"

101
00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:14.653
the mayor shouted.

102
00:06:14.673 --> 00:06:17.435
"Is this another prank, Freaky?"

103
00:06:18.635 --> 00:06:19.556
Ben looked around.

104
00:06:20.697 --> 00:06:23.158
On each table was a large round pie.

105
00:06:23.178 --> 00:06:26.680
"That must be the pizza," thought Ben.

106
00:06:27.616 --> 00:06:30.258
Ben thought the pizza smelled and looked delicious.

107
00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.282
The human kids, however, didn't seem to think so.

108
00:06:36.583 --> 00:06:39.485
They all stared at their food, looking scared.

109
00:06:40.746 --> 00:06:42.347
Mr. Freaky looked shocked.

110
00:06:43.408 --> 00:06:45.469
"What are you talking about, Mayor?

111
00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:48.351
I thought humans loved pizza!"

112
00:06:49.272 --> 00:06:51.214
The mayor's face was bright red.

113
00:06:51.234 --> 00:06:57.457
"Not when it's covered in in What on earth is it covered in?"

114
00:06:57.477 --> 00:07:02.358
"That's just pond scum and worm guts," said Mr.

115
00:07:02.418 --> 00:07:07.239
Freaky. The color instantly drained from Mayor Hubbletree's face.

116
00:07:07.259 --> 00:07:10.140
"It's worse than I thought!

117
00:07:10.900 --> 00:07:12.181
We can't eat this!"

118
00:07:13.581 --> 00:07:16.722
The mayor reached into his pocket and pulled out a cell phone.

119
00:07:16.742 --> 00:07:20.243
"I'm ordering pizza from Enzo's, in People Place.

120
00:07:21.223 --> 00:07:23.384
And you're going to pay for it, Freaky!"
